 "remarks": "Built by an award-winning builder and thoughtfully updated throughout, this exceptional home offers timeless design, quality craftsmanship, and a highly desirable location close to town, shopping, and everyday conveniences. A welcoming open floor plan features elegant living and dining spaces, a private home office, and a gourmet kitchen that seamlessly flows into the sun-filled family room with custom millwork and views of the professionally landscaped yard. The updated kitchen showcases new countertops, backsplash, refinished cabinetry, and updated appliances, creating a stylish and functional heart of the home. Upstairs, the renovated primary suite offers a luxurious retreat with a beautifully updated bath and generous walk-in closets, while three additional bedrooms and two full baths complete the second level. The finished lower level provides versatile space ideal for a playroom, media room, gym, or study area. Outside, a spacious terrace, outdoor grilling area, and newly fenced backyard create the perfect setting for entertaining and everyday enjoyment. Move-in ready and designed for today's lifestyle, this home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience.",
